<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>智能新闻| smithsonianmag.com</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/rss/smart-news/</link><description>智能新闻的 RSS 提要</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 12:37:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>这本图书馆的书已经过期 150 年了。对于刚归还书的人来说幸运的是，图书馆员不会强制收取 20,000 美元的滞纳金</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-library-book-was-150-years-overdue-fortunately-for-the-man-who-just-returned-it-librarians-wont-be-enforcing-a-20000-late-fee-180989339/</link><description>自 1870 年代以来，澳大利亚图书馆很可能就失踪了《雅典古物》。工作人员表示，它的恢复是“一个不太可能的生存（书籍）和救赎（借阅者）的故事”</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-library-book-was-150-years-overdue-fortunately-for-the-man-who-just-returned-it-librarians-wont-be-enforcing-a-20000-late-fee-180989339/</guid></item><item><title>肉类并不是促使早期人类进化出更大大脑的唯一食物。糖可能也促进了器官的增大</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/meat-wasnt-the-only-food-that-drove-early-humans-to-evolve-bigger-brains-sugar-may-have-fueled-the-organs-enlargement-too-180989335/</link><description>科学家们研究了四百万年的古人类饮食。他们发现，在烹饪之前，天然糖可能以葡萄糖的形式为正在发育的大脑提供能量，使淀粉类食物更容易消化</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 20:27:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/meat-wasnt-the-only-food-that-drove-early-humans-to-evolve-bigger-brains-sugar-may-have-fueled-the-organs-enlargement-too-180989335/</guid></item><item><title>著名作曲家诞辰 270 周年数月后，萨尔茨堡 200 多尊莫扎特金色雕像被盗</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/more-than-200-golden-mozart-statuettes-stolen-from-salzburg-months-after-famed-composers-270th-birthday-180989332/</link><description>奥地利公共艺术装置盗窃案并不是作曲家微型雕像第一次被盗</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:07:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/more-than-200-golden-mozart-statuettes-stolen-from-salzburg-months-after-famed-composers-270th-birthday-180989332/</guid></item><item><title>一家航空航天初创公司刚刚获得测试向地球发射阳光的批准。这就是专家们担心并请愿的原因</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/an-aerospace-startup-just-got-approval-to-test-beaming-sunlight-to-earth-heres-why-experts-are-worried-and-petitioning-180989323/</link><description>Reflect Orbital 的目标是到 2035 年发射多达 50,000 颗配备镜子的卫星，为地球上的太阳能电池板提供阳光。批评者担心对野生动物、天文学研究和人类健康的影响</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 17:38:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/an-aerospace-startup-just-got-approval-to-test-beaming-sunlight-to-earth-heres-why-experts-are-worried-and-petitioning-180989323/</guid></item><item><title>从腋窝到脚部，令人惊讶的是，我们的怕痒部位普遍存在。这一发现提供了有关感觉进化起源的线索</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/from-armpits-to-feet-our-ticklish-hot-spots-are-surprisingly-universal-the-finding-offers-clues-about-the-sensations-evolutionary-origins-180989324/</link><description>一项新的研究探讨了痒痒症的基本原理，这是一种人们知之甚少的瘙痒类型，由用力、重复的触摸引起，通常会引起笑声和蠕动</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/from-armpits-to-feet-our-ticklish-hot-spots-are-surprisingly-universal-the-finding-offers-clues-about-the-sensations-evolutionary-origins-180989324/</guid></item><item><title>观看欧洲上空日全食的壮丽照片，展示太阳的美丽和天空观测的奇迹</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-magnificent-photos-of-the-total-solar-eclipse-over-europe-that-showcase-the-suns-beauty-and-the-wonder-of-skywatching-180989325/</link><description>周三，月球的阴影席卷了地球，吸引了全球数百万人的目光。这是自 2024 年 4 月北美日食以来的首次日全食</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-magnificent-photos-of-the-total-solar-eclipse-over-europe-that-showcase-the-suns-beauty-and-the-wonder-of-skywatching-180989325/</guid></item><item><title>几千年前，丹尼索瓦人可能体型庞大，尤其是与他们的古代人类邻居相比</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/thousands-of-years-ago-denisovans-might-have-been-huge-especially-compared-to-their-archaic-human-neighbors-180989327/</link><description>新的研究为我们生活在亚洲的已灭绝表亲提供了罕见的见解，他们可能比娇小的“直立人”还要高大</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 22:14:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/thousands-of-years-ago-denisovans-might-have-been-huge-especially-compared-to-their-archaic-human-neighbors-180989327/</guid></item><item><title>麻省理工学院的一位历史学家发现了这个长期以来被认为是波士顿倾茶事件纪念品的中国标签的惊人真相</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-historian-at-mit-discovered-the-surprising-truth-about-this-chinese-label-long-thought-to-be-a-souvenir-of-the-boston-tea-party-180989328/</link><description>波士顿旧南会议厅展出的文物传奇展示了历史研究的演变</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 21:17:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-historian-at-mit-discovered-the-surprising-truth-about-this-chinese-label-long-thought-to-be-a-souvenir-of-the-boston-tea-party-180989328/</guid></item><item><title>NASA 完成了航行者 2 号探测器的大胆“大爆炸”修复，使其能够继续研究星际空间</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/nasa-completes-daring-big-bang-fix-on-the-voyager-2-probe-allowing-it-to-keep-studying-interstellar-space-180989312/</link><description>科学家们将探测器的三个加热装置更换为消耗更少能量的装置，他们可能会对旅行者 1 号做同样的事情。这两个航天器都在大约 50 年前发射</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 20:09:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/nasa-completes-daring-big-bang-fix-on-the-voyager-2-probe-allowing-it-to-keep-studying-interstellar-space-180989312/</guid></item><item><title>继教皇利奥十四世通谕之后，梵蒂冈宣布举办新的艺术三年展，庆祝人工智能时代的人类创造力和同理心</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/following-pope-leo-vivs-encyclical-the-vatican-announces-a-new-art-triennial-celebrating-human-creativity-and-empathy-in-the-age-of-ai-180989321/</link><description>随着天主教会继续强调人类创造力和关系而非人工智能工具，100 多名艺术家将在四大洲展示他们的艺术</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 19:00:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/following-pope-leo-vivs-encyclical-the-vatican-announces-a-new-art-triennial-celebrating-human-creativity-and-empathy-in-the-age-of-ai-180989321/</guid></item><item><title>令人惊叹的新图像揭示了太阳表面的漩涡。旋转结构可能有助于为太阳耀斑提供动力</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/stunning-new-images-reveal-whirlpools-on-the-suns-surface-the-swirling-strutures-might-help-power-solar-flares-180989292/</link><description>首次在太阳光球层中直接观察到，这些漩涡可能会编织磁场，被认为是能量积聚和最终爆发的原因。这些特征还提供了为什么太阳外层大气比其表面温度高数百万度的线索</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:19:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/stunning-new-images-reveal-whirlpools-on-the-suns-surface-the-swirling-strutures-might-help-power-solar-flares-180989292/</guid></item><item><title>沉船潜水员发现了一瓶 162 年维多利亚女王统治时期酿造的吉尼斯黑啤酒——他们想喝一口</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/shipwreck-divers-discovered-a-162-year-old-bottle-of-guinness-brewed-during-the-reign-of-queen-victoria-and-they-want-to-take-a-swig-180989320/</link><description>啤酒保存在密封的玻璃瓶中，可以安全取样。该团队还希望对酵母的 DNA 进行测序，以重现 19 世纪黑啤酒的味道</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:28:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/shipwreck-divers-discovered-a-162-year-old-bottle-of-guinness-brewed-during-the-reign-of-queen-victoria-and-they-want-to-take-a-swig-180989320/</guid></item><item><title>美洲狮可能会让您开车回家更安全。当掠食者在附近时，鹿往往会避开道路，以防止发生碰撞</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/pumas-might-be-making-your-drive-home-safer-when-the-predators-are-around-deer-tend-to-avoid-roads-preventing-some-collisions-180989314/</link><description>一项新的研究表明，在华盛顿的奥林匹克半岛，野猫的出现使得鹿与车辆相撞的可能性在五年内下降了 67%，并且残骸数量总体下降了 76%</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/pumas-might-be-making-your-drive-home-safer-when-the-predators-are-around-deer-tend-to-avoid-roads-preventing-some-collisions-180989314/</guid></item><item><title>英国考古学家在准备道路建设时出土了一把罗马时代的指甲清洁器，其手柄形状像阴茎</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-in-England-preparing-for-road-construction-unearthed-a-roman-era-fingernail-cleaner-with-a-handle-shaped-like-a-penis-180989318/</link><description>罗马人认为阳具是好运的象征，并用它来装饰物品、标记墙壁和激发雕塑灵感</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 22:45:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-in-England-preparing-for-road-construction-unearthed-a-roman-era-fingernail-cleaner-with-a-handle-shaped-like-a-penis-180989318/</guid></item><item><title>西班牙将迎来日全食。马德里博物馆正在用数字艺术品来庆祝“在日食之光”下照亮其画作</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-total-solar-eclipse-is-coming-to-spain-this-madrid-museum-is-celebrating-with-a-digital-artwork-illuminating-its-paintings-in-the-light-of-the-eclipse-180989311/</link><description>普拉多的一部新动画名为“El Prado a la luz del eclipse”，使用人工智能来想象戈雅和委拉斯开兹的杰作，就好像他们的场景发生在日全食期间一样</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 21:08:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-total-solar-eclipse-is-coming-to-spain-this-madrid-museum-is-celebrating-with-a-digital-artwork-illuminating-its-paintings-in-the-light-of-the-eclipse-180989311/</guid></item><item><title>如何在直播中观看日全食，从自己的家中见证罕见的日冕景象</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/how-to-watch-the-total-solar-eclipse-on-a-live-stream-witnessing-the-rare-view-of-the-suns-corona-from-your-own-home-180989315/</link><description>周三的日食将为俄罗斯、格陵兰岛、冰岛、葡萄牙和西班牙的部分地区带来黑暗的天空。但通过这些在线广播，您可以从任何地方观看这一奇观</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 20:35:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/how-to-watch-the-total-solar-eclipse-on-a-live-stream-witnessing-the-rare-view-of-the-suns-corona-from-your-own-home-180989315/</guid></item><item><title>这款与雨湖奥及布威社区合作创建的新应用程序旨在保护土著语言和知识</title><link>https:/