疫苗的费用</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:41:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/for-the-first-time-an-mrna-flu-shot-will-be-available-to-some-people-in-the-united-states-heres-what-you-should-know-180989305/</guid></item></channel></rss>